sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant P as Payment
    participant R as Restaurant
    participant N as Notification
    Customer->>API: POST /orders
    API->>DB: Save PENDING
    API->>MQ: Publish order.created
    API-->>Customer: 202 Accepted
    par Independent consumers
        MQ->>P: order.created
        MQ->>R: order.created
        MQ->>N: order.created
    end
    P->>DB: PAYMENT_PROCESSING then PAID
    P->>MQ: Publish order.paid
    R->>DB: Restaurant notified and inventory reserved
    MQ->>N: order.paid
    N->>DB: Notification and COMPLETED
    Customer->>API: GET /orders/{id}
    API-->>Customer: Status and timeline
